  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Terminal
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<color=yellow><b>Print</b></color>

    The <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#55FF55>print()</color></font> function is used to display messages
    and values in the Terminal.

    It is commonly used to show information during
    program execution.


    Example:

    <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#55FF55>print</color>("Hello")</font>


    <color=yellow><b>Terminal
    Panel</b></color>

    The Terminal panel can be shown or hidden using the Terminal
    button.

    During tutorials, the system may also send important messages and
    guidance through the Terminal, so checking it regularly is recommended.'
  isImageBig: 0
